<li id="bib.bib18" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Hosseini et al. [2014]</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Mohammad Javad Hosseini, Hannaneh Hajishirzi, Oren Etzioni, and Nate Kushman.

