<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Commonsense Reasoning</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use the following hyperparameters for fine-tuning for the Commonsense Reasoning benchmark. The learning rates are based on the suggestions in the original paper.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
