<section id="A1.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.4 </span>Decoding Hyperparameters</h3>

<div id="A1.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For commonsense reasoning, we generate at most 32 new tokens. For Arithmetic reasoning, we generate at most 512 new tokens.</p>
</div>
